    "updated_at": "2022-10-12T15:46:10Z",
    "body": "But it's clear what kind of symbol literal is being discussed, no? With `long` vs an identifier whose value is \"`long`\". Not sure why a specific name is needed given that context.\r\n\r\nAnd also, there is no actual specific name defined for them in the specification and using the style is not great from an accessibility perspective. I supposed based on that we should adjust some earlier bits in this section as well.",
