    "updated_at": "2022-10-12T16:05:21Z",
    "body": "For the upper paragraph I guess you're right, but it's less clear for \"The IDL syntax is case sensitive, both for the terminal symbols used in the grammar and the values used for identifier terminals\". Both are terminals, anyway...\r\n\r\nI'd prefer removing the words from the upper paragraph and keep it for the lower one.",
